WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.658 --> 00:00:03.299
- Court is in session.

00:00:03.299 --> 00:00:06.466
(inspirational music)

00:00:14.338 --> 00:00:16.699
- Plaintiff Mr. Cohen is
suing his current roommate

00:00:16.699 --> 00:00:19.020
Mr. Huber for only showering once a week,

00:00:19.020 --> 00:00:21.499
and using a self-prepared
slurry of avocado, oatmeal,

00:00:21.499 --> 00:00:23.998
and egg whites in place
of commercial shampoo.

00:00:23.998 --> 00:00:26.239
- Alright gentleman, why are
you here before me today?

00:00:26.239 --> 00:00:29.759
- My roommate Mr. Huber is on
like this vegan all-natural

00:00:29.759 --> 00:00:34.397
kick and as such he has
foregone all basic hygiene,

00:00:34.397 --> 00:00:36.438
like shampoo, soap, toothpaste,

00:00:36.438 --> 00:00:38.387
(sighs)

00:00:38.387 --> 00:00:39.337
he mells like garbage.

00:00:39.337 --> 00:00:42.175
- I mean you're not supposed
to shower, you know,

00:00:42.175 --> 00:00:43.256
every day of the week,

00:00:43.256 --> 00:00:46.636
so I have developed my own
concoction that is all-natural,

00:00:46.636 --> 00:00:47.976
with no chemicals.

00:00:47.976 --> 00:00:49.516
- And your objection with it is what?

00:00:49.516 --> 00:00:51.936
It smells bad, it's making you sick?

00:00:51.936 --> 00:00:53.796
- He smells like the
last day of Burning Man.

00:00:53.796 --> 00:00:56.056
- Sir you come before the
court, but what damages

00:00:56.056 --> 00:00:56.889
are you looking for here?

00:00:56.889 --> 00:00:58.722
- I'm looking for 650 dollars

00:00:58.722 --> 00:01:00.388
in reimbursements for groceries.

00:01:00.388 --> 00:01:01.971
(pounding)
(laughs)

00:01:01.971 --> 00:01:03.689
(gavel banging)

00:01:03.689 --> 00:01:04.548
- No more outbursts.

00:01:04.548 --> 00:01:05.489
- Everyday.

00:01:05.489 --> 00:01:08.089
- How did you arrive at that figure?

00:01:08.089 --> 00:01:09.348
- Yeah, good.

00:01:09.348 --> 00:01:12.688
- I mostly just multiplied
by two or three the amount

00:01:12.688 --> 00:01:14.128
of groceries that I bought.

00:01:14.128 --> 00:01:17.108
- So that's, the amount
of avocados, pro rata?

00:01:17.108 --> 00:01:18.988
- Amortize the arbitration--

00:01:18.988 --> 00:01:20.796
- Amortize the arbitration,

00:01:20.796 --> 00:01:22.528
the pro rata over the course of the--

00:01:22.528 --> 00:01:23.663
- Depreciation.

00:01:23.663 --> 00:01:25.727
- The FICA, sure, yeah, that makes sense.

00:01:25.727 --> 00:01:27.087
- How am I supposed to know,

00:01:27.087 --> 00:01:28.306
if we both buy avocados,

00:01:28.306 --> 00:01:30.326
how am I supposed to know
that I'm using his avocados?

00:01:30.326 --> 00:01:31.746
I mean they're all in one basket.

00:01:31.746 --> 00:01:33.526
- Yeah I have a couple
questions about the avocados.

00:01:33.526 --> 00:01:34.826
Hard, or soft?

00:01:34.826 --> 00:01:37.567
- Soft, I get them whenever
the ripe sticker is on them.

00:01:37.567 --> 00:01:39.525
- Thick, or long?

00:01:39.525 --> 00:01:40.358
- Thick.

00:01:40.358 --> 00:01:41.191
- Girth?

00:01:41.191 --> 00:01:42.024
- We're talking--

00:01:42.024 --> 00:01:42.857
- Girthy, very girthy.

00:01:42.857 --> 00:01:43.785
- Very girthy--

00:01:43.785 --> 00:01:44.618
- Yeah, little seed, very girthy.

00:01:44.618 --> 00:01:46.798
- Understood, tell me again
what the other elements

00:01:46.798 --> 00:01:48.338
of this were, the avocados and--

00:01:48.338 --> 00:01:49.416
- So it's half an avocado.

00:01:49.416 --> 00:01:50.249
- Half.

00:01:50.249 --> 00:01:52.596
- A tablespoon of coconut
oil which I melt down.

00:01:52.596 --> 00:01:55.695
I process some oatmeal, put that in there

00:01:55.695 --> 00:01:58.801
and then I also use one egg.

00:01:58.801 --> 00:02:01.153
And he only eats egg whites so I

00:02:01.153 --> 00:02:03.861
(gavel banging)

00:02:03.861 --> 00:02:05.069
- If it pleases the court, and it does,

00:02:05.069 --> 00:02:08.550
I would like the defendant to
please step forward and see

00:02:08.550 --> 00:02:09.705
me in chambers.

00:02:09.705 --> 00:02:12.705
(suspenseful music)

00:02:17.538 --> 00:02:19.390
(inhales loudly)

00:02:19.390 --> 00:02:22.530
- That's disgusting, it's
gonna make the, you can return.

00:02:22.530 --> 00:02:24.870
- That's what I deal with every day.

00:02:24.870 --> 00:02:25.703
- Understood.

00:02:25.703 --> 00:02:26.536
- Every day.

00:02:26.536 --> 00:02:28.150
He smell's like leftover Denny's.

00:02:28.150 --> 00:02:30.990
- I have brought Exhibit A.

00:02:30.990 --> 00:02:34.270
- I got all the exhibit
I'm willing to get, sir.

00:02:34.270 --> 00:02:36.853
If you stank, you are not dank.

00:02:38.425 --> 00:02:39.790
That's what they say.

00:02:39.790 --> 00:02:41.470
I watched the People vs. OJ Simpson.

00:02:41.470 --> 00:02:42.303
- Me too.

00:02:42.303 --> 00:02:43.727
- It's amazing isn't it, dude!

00:02:43.727 --> 00:02:45.003
- Right, it's good.

00:02:45.003 --> 00:02:45.836
- Isn't it amazing?

00:02:45.836 --> 00:02:46.988
- I'm kind of addicted to it.

00:02:46.988 --> 00:02:49.696
- Oh my God, how crazy is John Travolta?

00:02:49.696 --> 00:02:50.529
He's like doing a thing.

00:02:50.529 --> 00:02:52.326
- His face kind of doesn't
move, it's just like

00:02:52.326 --> 00:02:53.226
- [Judge] Oh it's amazing.

00:02:53.226 --> 00:02:54.887
- [Mr. Huber] Yeah, it's really good.

00:02:54.887 --> 00:02:56.787
- How long has this conflict been brewing?

00:02:56.787 --> 00:03:01.267
- I've been doing this vegan
all-natural organic shampoo

00:03:01.267 --> 00:03:03.166
for six months.

00:03:03.166 --> 00:03:05.127
- If it bothers Mr. Cohen
so much, why can't you

00:03:05.127 --> 00:03:06.526
just use shampoo?

00:03:06.526 --> 00:03:10.101
- I used a shampoo face
wash body wash one time,

00:03:10.101 --> 00:03:12.809
and it made me break out
into hives, so I haven't

00:03:12.809 --> 00:03:13.926
trusted it since.

00:03:13.926 --> 00:03:16.686
- I'm just trying to get a
picture of what the conflict is

00:03:16.686 --> 00:03:19.936
really like, beyond the terrible smell.

00:03:22.177 --> 00:03:24.506
So just that, if we can
solve that then we can bring

00:03:24.506 --> 00:03:26.027
prosperity and happiness.

00:03:26.027 --> 00:03:27.326
- I never knew that he
felt this way about me.

00:03:27.326 --> 00:03:28.159
- I tell him every day.

00:03:28.159 --> 00:03:30.492
- Mmhmm, mmhmm, mmhmm.

00:03:30.492 --> 00:03:32.085
- Anything further that you
would like the court to know

00:03:32.085 --> 00:03:33.406
before I render a decision?

00:03:33.406 --> 00:03:36.845
- That I don't use my product on animals,

00:03:36.845 --> 00:03:38.860
(laughs)

00:03:38.860 --> 00:03:41.098
so I mean, I'm doing
good stuff here with--

00:03:41.098 --> 00:03:42.039
- Do you have animals?

00:03:42.039 --> 00:03:42.979
- At home?

00:03:42.979 --> 00:03:44.078
- Like in his hair?

00:03:44.078 --> 00:03:45.328
- I mean where?

00:03:47.414 --> 00:03:48.779
- Sure I mean there's animals everywhere.

00:03:48.779 --> 00:03:51.696
- But do you have animals anywhere?

00:03:54.109 --> 00:03:54.942
- No.

00:03:56.259 --> 00:03:59.509
- Well then, isn't it disingenuous sir,

00:04:00.379 --> 00:04:03.640
to come before this court and claim

00:04:03.640 --> 00:04:06.307
that you do not test on animals?

00:04:07.899 --> 00:04:11.899
That you just admitted,
you don't have anywhere.

00:04:16.177 --> 00:04:17.177
- Yes.

00:04:17.177 --> 00:04:18.077
- Thank you.

00:04:18.077 --> 00:04:21.918
You know, the court is reminded
of Joseph Stalin, who said

00:04:21.918 --> 00:04:22.877
- Of course

00:04:22.877 --> 00:04:25.177
- "You can't make an omelet
without breaking some eggs."

00:04:25.177 --> 00:04:26.010
- Exactly.

00:04:27.348 --> 00:04:28.433
- Perchance you--

00:04:28.433 --> 00:04:29.513
- Can't have good hair

00:04:29.513 --> 00:04:31.293
- can't make a fragrant
scent without breaking

00:04:31.293 --> 00:04:32.754
somebody else's eggs.

00:04:32.754 --> 00:04:35.085
- No you definitely can,
you can use shampoo.

00:04:35.085 --> 00:04:36.918
(gavel banging)

00:04:36.918 --> 00:04:38.569
- I've heard enough the court
will now render a verdict,

00:04:38.569 --> 00:04:41.950
after a moment of deliberation.

00:04:41.950 --> 00:04:44.950
(suspenseful music)

00:04:58.180 --> 00:04:59.263
The court
(gavel banging)

00:04:59.263 --> 00:05:00.661
hereby finds the favor of that guy.

00:05:00.661 --> 00:05:01.994
(claps)

00:05:01.994 --> 00:05:02.827
- Woo!

00:05:02.827 --> 00:05:05.035
- Thank you that's today's business.

00:05:05.035 --> 00:05:06.557
Everyone dismissed, thank you.

00:05:06.557 --> 00:05:07.416
(gavel banging)

00:05:07.416 --> 00:05:10.166
(dramatic music)

